SAMORUKHOV HAS AGREED TO NEXT ROUND OF TALKS BEGINNING IN WASHINGTON
ON MAY 17. COMPOSITION OF SOVIET DELEGATION IS AS FOLLOWS:
V.D. SAMORUKHOV, DEPUTY CHIEF OF INTERNATIONAL RELATIONS DEPARTMENT,
HEAD OF DELEGATION;
MR. TIKHONOV, COMMERCIAL MANAGER, AEROFLOT;
MR. KURANOV (FNU), SENIOR ADVISOR, LEGAL DIVISION;
MRS. SEMEMOVYKH (FNU), EXPERT ON INTERNATIONAL POOLING AGREEMENTS.
EMBASSY ALSO AFFIRMED WILLINGNESS OF US DELEGATION TO MEET IN MOSCOW
JUNE 7.
STOESSEL

