1.  SENATOR BIRCH BAYH HAS ASKED THE DEPARTMENT TO ALERT
POSTS TO HIS SON'S TRAVEL IN EUROPE ACCORDING TO THE FOL-
LOWING SCHEDULE.  PLEASE EXTEND APPROPRIATE COURTESIES.
SPAIN -- JULY 5-12;
FRANCE -- (NICE AND PARIS) -- JULY 13-19;
GERMANY -- JULY 20-26;
AUSTRIA -- (VIENNA) -- JULY 27 - AUGUST 2;
HUNGARY -- (BUDAPEST) -- AUGUST 3-4;
YUGOSLAVIA -- AUGUST 5-8;
GREECE -- (ATHENS) -- AUGUST 8-20.
2.  FYI:  BAYH MAY JOIN HIS SON IN GREECE; TRAVELLING TO
ATHENS ON INTELLIGENCE COMMITTEE MISSION.   CHRISTOPHER

EMBASSY AUTHORIZED TO PAY ANDERSON $689 U.S. FOR TRAVEL
ALLOWANCE CHARGING GRANT NUMBER 1961128.4; 1069; 610472;
1905; 310; 4100; 10011.  ROBINSON

