MALI HAS RECENTLY SWITCHED TO A NEW CENTRAL DIALING SYSTEM THAT
HAS CAUSED A CHANGE IN ALL LOCAL TELEPHONE NUMBERS. THIS CHANGE
HAS CAUSED A SWITCH FROM A FIVE DIGIT NUMBER TO SIX DIGITS. THE
NEW NUMBERS ARE:
EMBASSY: 22-48-35, 22-56-63, 22-56-64, 22-58-34;
USAID: 22-36-02;
PEACE CORPS: 22-44-79, 22-35-53;
USICA: (SAME AS FOR EMBASSY).
BYRNE




